OL,5,G1815 Back Where We Belong
OL,6,     FFor Coventry City fans, leaving
OL,7,     FHighfield Road was more than just
OL,8,     Fa stadium move, it was saying
OL,9,     Fgoodbye to home.
OL,10,G1830 Back Where We Belong
OL,11,     FAn era defined by uncertainty,
OL,12,     Ffinancial trouble and a growing
OL,13,     Fsense of helplessness as the club
OL,14,     Fbegan to lose its way.
OL,15,G1845 Back Where We Belong
OL,16,     FForced out of the Ricoh Arena,
OL,17,     FCoventry City entered one of the
OL,18,     Fmost painful chapters in its
OL,19,     Fhistory.
